actual_result: "Kernel and1200-token SDK CLI and MCP fixtures retain blocker and parent edges with usedTokens at or below1200 and an explicit omission receipt. Unchanged regressions fail on base13c19fe9. All68 linked cases, typecheck and source/static contracts pass. Qualified local startup-floor and broad coverage failures remain explicit; final hosted static and coverage are merge prerequisites."
